ersion as it stands  right now for $10 a month it's hard for  me to give Apple music my full stamp of  approval  it just has too many bugs and  frustrations in comparison to Spotify on  the other hand it has a great selection  of playlists and integrates right with  iTunes my advice try it out for the  first three months maybe by then Apple  wall fixed up some of the issues it's  like that Rolling Stone song
 

